abstract: >-
  MedOrqis is an open-source, evidence-grounded clinical AI skills ecosystem comprising 24 specialized
  clinical AI skills, 10 pure deterministic zero-token calculators (ESC 2024 CHA2DS2-VA, CKD-EPI 2021,
  Bedside Schwartz, Cockcroft-Gault, HAS-BLED, CURB-65, NEWS2, Wells Criteria), epistemic context provenance
  gating, and cross-platform adapters for Claude Code, Cursor, Antigravity, and the Model Context Protocol (MCP).
